  "startedAt": "2026-11-04T09:03:08.412Z",
  "steps": [
    "The platform control and existing event-audio starter options show exact ordinary GDScript source in Chinese, English and Japanese at 390px. Mode, path, focus, source and reachable Create/Cancel controls persist; cancelling writes nothing.",
    "Create opens an ordinary unsaved TXT draft; Save adds exactly its source and registration while preserving all existing author files.",
    "Manage existing behavior explicitly registers one script reference. The ordinary behavior editor adds one moving-platform binding and four explicit typed parameters, retains every existing binding, and preserves focus/review in three languages. Cancel discards the first binding review. Apply changes only a draft; Save changes only the behavior JSON.",
    "Reopening the saved behavior restores the same platform UUID, script identity and both literal event names. An unchanged review grants no Apply ticket and closing writes nothing.",
    "Reopening restores the platform UUID, all four literal parameters and typed initial_running=false. Unchanged review cannot apply. No other author script, scene or physics declaration changes."
  ],
